				</div>
			</div> <!--profilestats-->
		</div> <!--profileheader-->

		<h2 class="sectionheader">Bio</h2>
		<div class="profilebio section bio">
			<p class="firstparagraph">When you have a habit of taking the world on your shoulders, it's a good idea to have someone around who will help you carry the load.  And when Emma Watson's well-intentioned meddling gets her in too deep, Tiffany Mulheron is there to pull her back out.  The two are partners in every sense of the world.  Though Emma is almost always the one leading the charge, she never has to turn around to know Tiff is behind her.</p>
			
			<p>Make no mistake, though... Tiff is nobody's sidekick in the cage.  Once a frequent victim of the somewhat sadistic Nadine Coyle, she is now a force all her own.  A finely-honed weapon, capable of beating anyone you put in front of her.  In fact, her greatest nemesis now is probably Emma.  Battling with each other every day in training has turned the pair into mirror images of one another.  Which one is better?  Beats me... and the even split of their recent results suggests it's impossible to separate them.</p>
			
			<p>I do know this... I wouldn't want to piss either one of them off.</p>
		</div>

		<h2 id="awardssection" class="sectionheader">Awards</h2>
		<div id="profileawardslist" class="profileawards section bio">
			<!--The javascript code will insert the awards here-->
